-- title:
--   Unit idèles of an admissible modulus are idelic norms
-- statement:
--   Let $E \subseteq F$ be number fields with $F/E$ Galois and with commutative Galois group $\mathrm{Gal}(F/E) = F \simeq_{\mathrm{alg}[E]} F$. Let $\ell$ be a prime and $k$ a natural number such that every element of $\mathrm{Gal}(F/E)$ satisfies $x^{\ell^k} = 1$, with $\ell^k \mid 24$, and assume $[F:E] = \mathrm{finrank}_E F$ divides $24$. Let $\mathfrak f$ be an ideal of $\mathcal O_E$ which is an admissible modulus for $F/E$ in the sense of `IsAdmissibleModulus`: $\mathfrak f \neq 0$, and for every finite place $v$ of $E$ whose chosen prime `primeAbove E F v` of $\mathcal O_F$ has nontrivial inertia subgroup in $\mathrm{Gal}(F/E)$, the power $v^{\,\mathrm{admissibleExp}(v)} = v^{\,4e(2\mid v) + 2e(3\mid v) + 1}$ divides $\mathfrak f$, where $e(p \mid v)$ is the ramification index `Ideal.ramificationIdx'` of the ideal generated by $p$ at $v$. Then the subgroup `unitIdeles E 𝔣` of the idèle units $(\mathbb A_E)^\times$ — consisting of those $u$ whose finite component has valuation $1$ at every finite place $v$, satisfies $|u_v - 1| \le \exp(-\mathrm{ord}_v(\mathfrak f))$ at every $v$ dividing $\mathfrak f$ (the order being the multiplicity of $v$ in the factorisation of $\mathfrak f$), and is positive at every real embedding $\tau : E \to \mathbb R$ in the sense of `archSign` — is contained in the range of the idelic norm $(\mathbb A_F)^\times \to (\mathbb A_E)^\times$ attached to the adèlic base change `genuineBaseChange E F`, that is, of the unit map induced by the algebra norm of $\mathbb A_F$ over $\mathbb A_E$.
--
--   This is the idelic norm-surjectivity input to the construction of the idelic Artin map for abelian layers of exponent dividing $24$: admissibility of the modulus guarantees that each local component of a unit idèle of level $\mathfrak f$ is a local norm. It is used in the proof of [`NumberField.exists_idelicArtinMap_ker_eq_and_surjective_and_eq_finprod_artinFrob_of_dvd_twentyFour`](thm.html#NumberField.exists_idelicArtinMap_ker_eq_and_surjective_and_eq_finprod_artinFrob_of_dvd_twentyFour).
